cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Observational Reinforcement Learning: Theory, Architectures and Social Learning Dynamics"
abstract: >
  An experimental framework comparing classical Q-learning, Behavioral Cloning,
  and a hybrid Observational RL approach on configurable GridWorld environments.
  This project supports doctoral research on the conditions under which learning
  from observed demonstrations improves agent performance and generalization.
